BT /F1 10 Tf 28 429.6 Td (pandemic?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 416.6 Td (Answer: Those that stuck to the status quo suffered \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 397.6 Td (9. What is one way innovation creates more added value?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 384.6 Td (Answer: By creating a unique selling proposition \(USP\) \227 Correct) Tj ET
